# The cache-load race: a load that read the store before a change installs its
# result after the eviction ran, so the pre-change setting stays cached.
MODULE: CacheCurrentOrPendingOvertakenLoadInstalls
TARGET: CacheCurrentOrPending
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a load an eviction overtook still installs the pre-change setting
PERTURBS: InstallLoad

--- FIND
    /\ cache' = IF overtaken[s] THEN cache ELSE [cache EXCEPT ![s] = loadVal[s]]
    /\ cacheRev' = IF overtaken[s] THEN cacheRev ELSE [cacheRev EXCEPT ![s] = loadRev[s]]
--- REPLACE
    /\ cache' = [cache EXCEPT ![s] = loadVal[s]]
    /\ cacheRev' = [cacheRev EXCEPT ![s] = loadRev[s]]
--- END
